VALUES (315, 'tt0103549', NULL, 'Sightings', 'Sightings', 'tv', 1992, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvQifGyuenpiPaNkf53iyD4l0YR.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3wndA0nCjZUQ8M2HdykEAPL5uU5.jpg', 'Sightings is an American paranormal and news television series that originally aired from April 17, 1992 to August 1, 1997. The program began as a special titled The UFO Report: Sightings on October 18, 1991. The original Concept Creator and Supervising Producer of that hour special produced by Paramount for Fox TV was Linda Moulton Howe, an Emmy Award-winning TV producer and documentary filmmaker of TV specials about science and the environment. One of her Emmy award-winning broadcasts was A Strange Harvest, about the worldwide animal-mutilation mystery linked by law enforcement to extraterrestrial biological entities.', NULL, NULL, 7.3431, 8.5, 0, 10.01, '2026-10-18 22:36:17', '2026-10-18 22:36:17')
