VALUES (20770, 'tt0179116', NULL, 'But I''m a Cheerleader', 'But I''m a Cheerleader', 'movie', 2000, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8huDg3Q0EmcWuN9HgYsO8ylAp9f.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f4ZgIaMpOWd6rewhCfoIIMqWquh.jpg', 'Megan is an all-American girl. A cheerleader. She has a boyfriend. But Megan doesn''t like kissing her boyfriend very much. And she''s pretty touchy with her cheerleader friends. Her conservative parents worry that she must be a lesbian and send her off to "sexual redirection" school, where she must, with other lesbians and gays learn how to be straight.', NULL, NULL, 4.7868, 7.1, 0, 4.80848888888888907e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-10-18 22:36:17')
