VALUES (1408493, 'tt35692176', NULL, 'The Turkish Coffee Table', 'Cam Sehpa', 'movie', 2026, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keGMCONOSK0omAk1uMdilSftePd.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nUMxXcgdQOtphcObnIbokw7dRZU.jpg', 'When Zehra and İbrahim, a couple adjusting to new parenthood, argue over a coffee table, it seems like a harmless domestic spat. Wanting to assert himself for once, İbrahim insists on buying it. But when he’s left alone to assemble it, he makes a single irreversible mistake — and begins spiraling into a pit of lies, panic, and performative calm as he tries to hide the truth from the people he loves the most.', NULL, NULL, 1.3641, 6.5, 0, 1.11566666666666662e+01, '2026-08-03 14:31:56', '2026-10-18 22:36:17')
