VALUES (682110, 'tt12888462', NULL, 'My Octopus Teacher', 'My Octopus Teacher', 'movie', 2020, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvTVZb7hBC8tZAGoEhH5eiMJu2B.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sW7VOrkHKYIeV9PaYc5IqGU2XK8.jpg', 'After years of swimming every day in the freezing ocean at the tip of Africa, Craig Foster meets an unlikely teacher: a young octopus who displays remarkable curiosity. Visiting her den and tracking her movements for months on end he eventually wins the animal’s trust and they develop a never-before-seen bond between human and wild animal.', NULL, NULL, 3.031, 7.896, 0, 9.18, '2026-08-09 02:29:31', '2026-10-18 22:36:17')
